# Temporary Starlette exceptions mirrored from the pip-audit gate in
# .github/workflows/security.yml. FastAPI 0.136 resolves Starlette 0.52.x, while
# these fixes require Starlette 1.x; production runs Linux containers.
# Revisit before this expires and remove once the framework stack supports 1.x.
#
# This file must list every FIXED-UPSTREAM CVE that the pip-audit gate
# accepts, because Trivy runs with `ignore-unfixed: true`: unfixed advisories
# are filtered automatically, but fixed-upstream ones (Starlette 1.x) are
# reported and would hard-fail the container scan unless suppressed here.
# scripts/check_trivyignore_sync.py keeps this list in lockstep with the
# pip-audit `--ignore-vuln` set so the two gates can't drift again (#2528).
#
# PYSEC-2025-183 (PyJWT) and PYSEC-2024-278 (langchain-community) are
# intentionally NOT listed: Trivy keys Python advisories by CVE/GHSA and has
# no published fix, so `ignore-unfixed: true` already filters them.
